2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Gonzalo Pizarro y Rodríguez de Aguilar (1446–1522) was a Spanish Captain from the region of Extremadura who participated in several campaigns in Italy and Navarre. He is most famed for fathering the four Pizarro brothers, Francisc
2 CONC o (born 1471 to 1478), Hernando (born 1478 to 1508), Gonzalo (born 1502) and Juan (born 1511), who conquered the Inca Empire.
2 CONT
2 CONT His cousin fathered the also-famed conquistador Hernando Cortes, the conqueror of the Aztec Empire.  (wikipedia)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Alférez Real del Ejército de S. M. el Rey de España, Señor del Mayorazgo de la Casa de los Pizarro en Trujillo de Extremadura ca 1458-1522
