1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was appointed as "Alcalde de la Santa Hermandad" in 1643. His wife died in Nemiza, Nemocón, in 1686, while he had died in 1658. They had been married in 1628. His parents were don Bartolomé Pérez Cubillos and do
2 CONC ña Leonor Jiménez., while the parents of doña Mencia were don Juan de Silva y Collantes y doña Ana Cerón de Salazar.
