2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Pedro (Juan?) de SALAZAR. Isabel de TREVIÑO (aka Isabel de Quintanilla) and Pedro (Juan?) de SALAZAR were married. Children were: Ana de SALAZAR, Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño), Juana de Trevino SAL
2 CONC AZAR.
2 CONT
