2 CONT Beatriz de Torres, a mestiza from Turmequé, an ancient Chibcha settlement.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second wife of Francisco Sánchez Herreño.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband was a cleric first who disregarded his vows and had a relationship with her.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their illegitimate daughter was Francisca.
