1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt. Diego RODRIGUEZ74,739,1867 was born (date unknown). Diego Rodriguez was one of the 15 settlers who came with Diego Montemayor when he founded the city of Monterrey in 1596. Parents: Baltasar de SOSA and Ines 
2 CONC RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Sebastiana Quintanilla TREVIÑO. Sebastiana Quintanilla TREVIÑO and Capt. Diego RODRIGUEZ1867 were married. A census of the Villa of Cerralvo (Monterrey) conducted on September 4, 1626, Diego Rodriguez's dwelling is describ
2 CONC ed as being 50 paces from and facing the Convent of San Francisco. The dwelling contained 2 rooms and "un torrecilla alta", or small tower. Diego Rodriguez lived in one of the rooms, his brother Lucas Garcia lived in the other roo
2 CONC m with his family because he had no house at that time, and Diego Rodriguez' son-in-law Miguel de Montemayor lived with his family in the small tower. Children were: Monica RODRIGUEZ, Maria RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: Andrea RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b188.html#P951
2 CONT
2 CONT ===============================
2 CONT
2 CONT Villanueva de Cavazos, Lilia E. '' Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey'', Monterrey, Nuevo León, Mexico, 1991, pages 18-22. [Ramo Civil, Vol. 5, Exp. 22, Folio 3]   ...  The '''1643 will of Capitán Miguel De Montemayor'''  (dated 
2 CONC 11 October 1643) cites his parents, his wife '''Mónica Rodríguez''', '''her parents Capitán Diego Rodríguez and Sebastiana de Tremiño''', a deceased son Lucas, as well as his legitimate children Diego, Margarita, Petrona, María, F
2 CONC rancisco, Domingo, José, Bernardo, and Mateo.  Additionally, the will cites two "bastard" daughters: María, wife of Juan Maldonado, and Juana, wife of Andrés de Charles.  Further, the will directs that he be interred in Monterrey'
2 CONC s Iglesia Parroquial and states that he is ill near to death.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''____________________________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 3170. Capitan Diego RODRIGUEZ is printed as #3078. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3171. Sebastiana TREVINO QUINTANILLA was born in Mexico City,D. F.,Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://home.earthlink.net/~crisrendon/pafg23.htm#5297
2 CONT
